  characterName: Amina Aliyu
  promptText: "A municipal \u201Cgreen fund\u201D is acquiring assets that indirectly
    finance private detention services. Public exposure could topple the fund and
    harm local pensions many elders depend on; silence preserves livelihoods but
    conceals a possible injustice."
  leftAnswer: Uncovering the scheme may stop hidden harms even if it disrupts current
    benefits.
  rightAnswer: Protecting pensions keeps elders safe now while you seek less damaging
    remedies.
